SlateportCity_Mart_Text_H1::
    .string "The market row outside has things\n"
    .string "you'll see nowhere else.\p"
    .string "It doesn't have POTIONs when you\n"
    .string "need one at seven in the morning.\l"
    .string "That's what this place is for.$"

SlateportCity_Mart_Text_H2::
    .string "A GREAT BALL holds where a POKé\n"
    .string "BALL slips.\p"
    .string "There's one out past the harbor\n"
    .string "I've been failing to catch since\l"
    .string "spring.$"
